# Financial data — never commit
# Users bring their own files to the browser; nothing sensitive belongs in the repo.
# data/queries/ is excluded from this rule — those SQL files are safe to commit.
data/[0-9]*/

# Data exploration directory — local only
# Contains actual financial CSVs, processed transaction JSON, salary data, and PII.
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root so it does not match src/context/.
/context/
